      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought we decided we wanted consistency with the older APIs ? I remember we discussed CancellationSignal, and that\u0027s what we\u0027d do for a new API, but ISTM that consistency with discoverServices/stopServiceDiscovery and resolveService/stopServiceResolution is more important.",
      "revId": "a317e7478b59289c7cb387b03ef632d9553eb0de",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
